  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together fish sauce, yuzu juice, olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, and paprika.",
    "Add the cod fish pieces to the bowl and toss to coat.",
    "Thread the fish pieces onto skewers.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "Serve the skewers hot.",
    "Garnish with lemon wedges and paprika.",
    "Serve with a side of roasted vegetables."
